msgid ""
"Examples:\n"
"    - Fix / improve / explain this code.\n"
"    - Make it funny.\n"
"    - Add emojis!\n"
"    - Roast this!\n"
"    - Translate to English.\n"
"    - Make the text title case.\n"
"    - If it's all caps, make it all small, and vice-versa.\n"
"    - Write a reply to this.\n"
"    - Analyse potential biases in this news article."
msgstr ""
"示例：\n"
"    - 修复 / 改进 / 解释这段代码。\n"
"    - 让它更有趣。\n"
"    - 添加表情符号！\n"
"    - 吐槽一下！\n"
"    - 翻译成英文。\n"
"    - 将文本改为标题大小写。\n"
"    - 如果全是大写就改为小写，反之亦然。\n"
"    - 为此写一条回复。\n"
"    - 分析这篇新闻文章可能存在的偏见。"

