msgid ""
"⚠️  <b>Replace All</b> will remove <b>every</b> command currently installed "
"(including System commands) and replace them with the {0} command(s) from "
"this backup. <b>This cannot be undone.</b><br><br>Use <b>Import Selected</b>"
" to add only the commands you choose, without removing anything."
msgstr ""
"⚠️  <b>全部替换</b>将删除当前安装的<b>所有</b>命令（包括系统命令），并替换为此备份中的 {0} "
"个命令。<b>此操作无法撤销。</b><br><br>如只想添加所选命令而不删除任何内容，请使用<b>导入所选项</b>。"

msgid ""
"This will permanently remove ALL {0} current command(s) (including System commands) and replace them with {1} command(s) from the backup.\n"
"\n"
"This cannot be undone. Are you sure?"
